# The native jobs of the complete Step profiles. The model README, "Inductive
# proofs", gives the argument. A split keeps its group's start, relation, and
# auxiliary equations, and the jobs check each pair of the group once.
next Authority Next
invariant AuthorityInvariant IndInv TypeInd
start IndStartWith
shared AuthorityPreservation PreservationNext
# These groups check each clause of OVERRIDE_AnchorStateInv as its own target.
clauses AnchorStateInv StepCommitRecords StepRestoreAnchors
first AuthorityInd StepSnapshotRestorable
first AuthorityIndAnchors StepSnapshotRestorable
first AuthorityIndProcess StepSnapshotRestorable StepCommitTurn StepRestoreOther
targets AuthorityIndProcess StepSnapshotRestorable Account=RestoreAccountInvPost Admin=RestoreAdminInvPost
targets AuthorityIndProcess StepRestoreOther End=EndInvPost Anchor=AnchorInvPost Remaining
actions AuthorityIndProcess StepCommitTurn AuthorityIndProcessStepCommitTurnJobs
